                <pb facs="1298" n="1284" sameAs="frus:frus1947v05/pg1284"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On the evening of November 24 the <hi rendition="#italic">Ad Hoc</hi> Committee
                    rejected by a 29 to 12 vote, with 14 abstentions, the third draft resolution of
                    Subcommittee <pb facs="1299" n="1285" xml:id="pg1285"/> 2 containing the unitary
                    plan for Palestine; see GA(II), <hi rendition="#italic">Ad Hoc Committee</hi>,
                    page 206. The text of the resolution is printed <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ibid.</hi>, page 302.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
